   '3. After all completion notifications, the lead appends each block to `40-consensus.md` (sequentially, under a `## <member>` heading) and reads it.\n4. **Crossed concurrence** (each member adopted the other\'s stance on the same point) → the lead appends a `LEAD RESOLUTION` line per protocol § Round 3 step 4; not an ESCALATE.'],
  ['skills/ask-consultant/team-mode.md',
